OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid as murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FRelatives of a man whose death has led
OL,7,Fto a murder investigation have
OL,8,Fdescribed him as "harmless".
OL,10,FThe family of Ian Davis, 56, said he
OL,11,Fwas an animal lover and would be
OL,12,F"missed and loved" after he was found
OL,13,Fdead in Liskeard on Sunday.
OL,15,FDevon and Cornwall Police said Davis,
OL,16,Fwho lived in the Cornish town, was
OL,17,Ffound with multiple injuries in a
OL,18,Fproperty on Baytree Hill at about 21:30
OL,19,FBST and had been pronounced dead at the
OL,20,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,345,340,200,160,0,100
