OL,3,GNEWSATributes paid as murder
OL,4,Ainvestigation continues
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men from Liskeard aged in their
OL,7,F30s, 40s and 50s, together with a man
OL,8,Ffrom Plymouth in his 20s, have been
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of murder and
OL,10,Freleased on bail.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
